Python and uv

Install:
  Install or self-update uv, install the default Python and upgrade uv-managed Python versions.

Upgrade:
  Run the same uv and managed Python update flow; preserve uv default directories.

Status:
  Report uv, Python, and locally installed managed Python versions.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  CLI tools such as ruff and pre-commit belong to tools.
